      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.TELEMETRY_HINT",
      "text": "Off by default. When enabled, the mod records event frequency, relationship distribution, mod stress effects, schedule share and performance timings on this device only. Duplicants use anonymous IDs; API keys, AI endpoints and save contents are excluded, and nothing is uploaded automatically. Export a diagnostic report from Social > Event Log while in a colony.",
